   "known_bug": "Test of Faith's prevention works but its +1/+1 counter rider never runs: effects/prevent_damage.go:96 only accepts ShieldEffectTarget$ ParentTarget (Test of Faith says Targeted) and rules/replacement_damage.go:212 resolves only a DealDamage PreventionSubAbility$ (this one is PutCounter); both emit a loud 'unimplemented' Note."
